ark 客户端）才用 UI 自动化脚本\n\n桌面端要注意：\n- 分辨率/窗口位置变了可能失效\n- 登录弹窗、升级弹窗会打断流程\n- 可能需要前台焦点（后台运行成功率低）\n\n你要的话我可以直接给你一份 **Windows 桌面版“自动点参加会议”Python脚本模板**（带重试、截图、失败告警）。","textSignature":"msg_054e6fade97934ad0169a7fd9e215c8191a43142d3057eaa6a"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":628,"output":333,"cacheRead":58496,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59457,"cost":{"input":0.001099,"output":0.004662,"cacheRead":0.010236799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0159978}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772617113651}}
